    docs: document event --task-id, --actor and --detail @file flags (DOC-33)
    
    Add 'Event flags (DOC-33)' section documenting the three previously
    undocumented boardctl event flags:
    - --task-id ID: associate event with a task row (task_id field)
    - --actor NAME: record who performed the action (actor field)
    - --detail @file: read detail JSON from file (mutually exclusive with
      --detail-text)
    
    Each flag's corresponding row key is named. Example invocation included.
    
    Fixes: DOC-33
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
